OPTION A — Minimal "More" everything
=====================================

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                         │
│  (tree content above)                                   │
│                                                         │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  [Boost]  [██░░ Claude]  [██░░ Codex]                   │  ← usage
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  [📁] [zen] [explode] [+task]  [···]  [⚙]               │  ← single icon row
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

· Inline:    workspace toggles + new task + ··· + settings
· In "···":  agent status, agent panel, terminals, update,
             leaderboard, usage analytics, onboarding,
             what's new, keyboard shortcuts, feedback,
             sidebar view switcher
· Settings = last as requested
· Pros:  cleanest, lowest visual weight
· Cons:  many things behind one click — discoverability hit
